%% Per-channel alarm states (evaluated every 5 minutes)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NORMAL
    NORMAL --> PENDING: latest value outside range
    PENDING --> NORMAL: back inside range (reset)
    PENDING --> ALARM: outside range for 20 min, no data gaps / notify
    ALARM --> ALARM: every 60 min / reminder
    ALARM --> NORMAL: 10 min inside range with 1 °C margin / notify
    ALARM --> NORMAL: alarm disabled for the channel (silent)
